OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G1/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FThe spending watchdog says the BBC's   
OL,8,F#700m savings programme is on course to
OL,9,Ffinish a year early, but a further     
OL,10,F#500m of cuts will involve tougher     
OL,11,Ftrade-offs.                            
OL,13,FThe next phase of cost-cutting at the  
OL,14,FBBC will be more difficult to achieve  
OL,15,Fand more apparent to viewers and       
OL,16,Flisteners than the savings made so far,
OL,17,Faccording to the National Audit Office 
OL,18,F(NAO).                                 
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14602
SC,0002
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FIn a value for money report published  
OL,8,Fon 20th November 2026, the public      
OL,9,Fspending watchdog examined the BBC's   
OL,10,F#700m savings and reinvestment         
OL,11,Fprogramme, alongside the corporation's 
OL,12,Fplans for a further round of cuts      
OL,13,Frunning to March 2029.                 
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14603
SC,0003
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,GSAVINGS AHEAD OF SCHEDULE              
OL,9,FThe BBC first set out plans in May 2022
OL,10,Ffor #500m of recurring annual savings  
OL,11,Fby March 2028. In 2024, it raised that 
OL,12,Ftarget by #200m to #700m.              
OL,14,FThe NAO reports that #602m of savings  
OL,15,Fwere classed as recurring in 2025/26,  
OL,16,Fwith a further #113m of one-off savings
OL,17,Fbringing the total reported to #715m.  
OL,18,FThe BBC expects to reach its #700m     
OL,19,Ftarget by March 2027, a year earlier   
OL,20,Fthan planned.                          
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14604
SC,0004
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FThe savings have come from reducing    
OL,8,Fstaff numbers, rationalising the BBC's 
OL,9,Festate, modernising technology,        
OL,10,Fsimplifying processes and changing the 
OL,11,Fmix and scope of its content and       
OL,12,Fservices.                              
OL,14,FBy March 2026, #489m had been          
OL,15,Freinvested, including in digital-first 
OL,16,Fpriorities such as iPlayer and video   
OL,17,Fand digital news, with the remainder   
OL,18,Fused to reduce overall spending.       
OL,19,FiPlayer recorded 15.4 million weekly   
OL,20,Fusers in 2025/26.                      
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14605
SC,0005
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,GFINANCIAL PRESSURES                    
OL,9,FThe report sets the savings against    
OL,10,Fcontinuing pressure on the BBC's       
OL,11,Ffinances. Licence fee income fell by   
OL,12,F26% in real terms ` some #1.3bn `      
OL,13,Fbetween 2016/17 and 2025/26. The       
OL,14,Flicence fee raised #3.879bn in 2025/26,
OL,15,Faccounting for 91% of the BBC's public 
OL,16,Fservice income.                        
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14606
SC,0006
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FThe BBC's public service broadcasting  
OL,8,Foperating deficit stood at #209m in    
OL,9,F2025/26, #115m more than the #94m it   
OL,10,Fhad planned. The deficit for the BBC   
OL,11,FGroup as a whole was #121m, and is     
OL,12,Fforecast to rise to #329m in 2026/27.  
OL,14,FCash reserves fell to #257m, a         
OL,15,Freal-terms reduction of #310m since    
OL,16,F2022/23.                               
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14607
SC,0007
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FThe proportion of UK adults using BBC  
OL,8,Ftelevision, iPlayer, radio or online   
OL,9,Fservices in an average week fell from  
OL,10,F90% in 2021/22 to 81% in 2025/26. Among
OL,11,F16 to 34-year-olds, weekly reach fell  
OL,12,Ffrom 81% to 63%.                       
OL,14,FOver the same period, the share of     
OL,15,Fadults who considered BBC News         
OL,16,Feffective at providing trustworthy news
OL,17,Ffell from 63% to 55%.                  
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14608
SC,0008
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G8/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FThe NAO notes that the declines in     
OL,8,Freach and trust reflect wider trends   
OL,9,Facross UK media, but says the BBC was  
OL,10,Funable to measure whether its savings  
OL,11,Fprogramme had contributed to them.     
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14609
SC,0009
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G9/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,GA TOUGHER ROUND                        
OL,9,FIn February 2026, the BBC set a further
OL,10,Fobjective to reduce spending by around 
OL,11,F10% by March 2029, measured against a  
OL,12,FMarch 2026 baseline. It expects this to
OL,13,Frequire at least #500m of additional   
OL,14,Frecurring annual savings.              
OL,16,FUnlike the previous programme, the new 
OL,17,Fsavings will not be reinvested. They   
OL,18,Fwill instead go towards closing the    
OL,19,FBBC's funding gap and supporting its   
OL,20,Flonger-term financial sustainability.  
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14610
SC,0010
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G10/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FThe programme includes a reduction of  
OL,8,Faround 11% in the BBC's workforce from 
OL,9,FMarch 2026, which the corporation has  
OL,10,Falready announced. Earlier this year,  
OL,11,Fthe BBC said it planned to cut about   
OL,12,F1,800 roles.                           
OL,14,FThe NAO says the BBC is anticipating   
OL,15,Fdifficult choices over the scale and   
OL,16,Fscope of its services, and that further
OL,17,Freductions in content are expected to  
OL,18,Fhave a greater impact on audiences. It 
OL,19,Falso warns that additional savings are 
OL,20,Flikely to be harder to find following  
OL,21,Fprevious rounds of cuts.               
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14611
SC,0011
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G11/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FTelevision programmes already dropped  
OL,8,Finclude Celebrity Mastermind, Blankety 
OL,9,FBlank, Live at the Apollo, Football    
OL,10,FFocus, Ski Sunday and RuPaul's Drag    
OL,11,FRace UK. On radio, BBC Radio 4's You   
OL,12,Fand Yours and The World Tonight are    
OL,13,Famong the programmes being removed from
OL,14,Fthe schedules.                         
OL,16,FThe BBC has also announced the closure 
OL,17,Fof the linear broadcast services of BBC
OL,18,FRadio 4 Extra, BBC Three and BBC       
OL,19,FScotland, with BBC Three and BBC       
OL,20,FScotland continuing as online-only     
OL,21,Fservices.                              
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14612
SC,0012
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G12/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,GGOVERNANCE AND OVERSIGHT               
OL,9,FThe NAO credits the BBC with delivering
OL,10,Fsignificant recurring savings and using
OL,11,Fthem to support its digital            
OL,12,Ftransformation, and says financial     
OL,13,Ftargets were tracked clearly.          
OL,15,FHowever, it found the corporation was  
OL,16,Fless able to show how it understood the
OL,17,Fwider effects of its decisions,        
OL,18,Fincluding their cumulative impact and  
OL,19,Fthe trade-offs between cost, audience  
OL,20,Fvalue and service provision.           
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14613
SC,0013
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G13/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FThe watchdog recommends that the BBC   
OL,8,Freview whether its governance          
OL,9,Farrangements are suitable for the scale
OL,10,Fand pace of the new programme, and make
OL,11,Fits risk management proportionate to   
OL,12,Fit, including defining its appetite for
OL,13,Frisk.                                  
OL,15,FIt also recommends a consistent        
OL,16,Fframework for assessing both financial 
OL,17,Fand non-financial impacts, such as     
OL,18,Feffects on audiences, services,        
OL,19,Freputation and capability, and that a  
OL,20,Fplanned lessons-learned review of the  
OL,21,F#700m programme be completed in time to
OL,22,Finform the new one.                    
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14614
SC,0014
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G14/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FGareth Davies, head of the NAO, noted  
OL,8,Fthat the BBC is just over a year away  
OL,9,Ffrom Charter renewal, saying "there is 
OL,10,Fno doubt that there are difficult      
OL,11,Fchoices ahead".                        
OL,13,FHe added that the corporation could    
OL,14,Fdraw on lessons from the #700m         
OL,15,Fprogramme, including strengthening its 
OL,16,Fapproach to risk and developing a      
OL,17,Fconsistent way of understanding the    
OL,18,Fconsequences of savings for audiences  
OL,19,Fand services.                          
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14615
SC,0015
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G15/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,GBBC RESPONSE                           
OL,9,FThe BBC welcomed the report. Its group 
OL,10,Fchief financial officer, Berangere     
OL,11,FMichel, said the corporation was       
OL,12,Fpleased the NAO had recognised the     
OL,13,Fsavings already delivered, with the    
OL,14,Fprogramme on track to meet its target a
OL,15,Fyear ahead of schedule.                
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14616
SC,0016
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Fri 27 NovC19:11/31
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G16/16
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCNAO warns next round of BBC cuts  
OL,4,Cwill be harder to deliver and more     
OL,5,Cvisible to audiences                   
OL,7,FShe said the BBC accepts the NAO's     
OL,8,Frecommendations and has already begun  
OL,9,Fputting them into practice, and that it
OL,10,Fwill continue to work with the         
OL,11,Fgovernment towards a new Charter that  
OL,12,Fsecures "sufficient, sustainable and   
OL,13,Funiversal funding".                    
OL,23,EPub: 20-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
